invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin_ticket.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: Ticket.fromOnTicket zeroes the ticket's QUIC version when it
  copies what on_ticket handed over, so toCfg presents a
  ticket_quic_version of 0 and init refuses to resume with it. The full
  handshake still completes, so only a resumption notices. loop_quic.zig
  resumes the ticket it took, in version 1 and in version 2, and objects.

--- old
        out.ticket.identity = null;
--- new
        out.ticket.identity = null;
        if (@hasField(c.ch_ticket, "quic_version")) out.ticket.quic_version = 0;
